@startuml
!theme plain

title frontend-click-test — 失败自动修复闭环
hide footbox

actor "开发者 / Codex" as author
participant "验收点提炼" as criteria
participant "测试执行编排" as orchestration
participant "Playwright CLI" as cli
participant "Bundled Chromium" as chromium
participant "根因定位与\n最小修复" as repair
participant "前端代码 / 配置" as code
participant "结果判定与\nMarkdown 报告" as report

author -> criteria : 提供需求、验收标准、实际改动
activate criteria
criteria -> criteria : 选择 3–7 个最小测试点
criteria --> orchestration : 测试点与前置条件
deactivate criteria

orchestration -> cli : open --browser=chromium
activate cli
cli -> chromium : 打开页面
activate chromium
chromium --> cli : 初始页面快照
deactivate chromium

loop 每个测试点
  orchestration -> cli : snapshot / click / fill
  cli -> chromium : 真实页面操作
  activate chromium
  chromium --> cli : 目标状态 / 可见结果
  deactivate chromium
  alt 目标状态满足
    cli --> orchestration : 通过证据
  else 失败且已获修复授权
    cli --> orchestration : 失败证据
    orchestration -> repair : 收集日志、URL、截图、请求\n定位根因
    repair -> code : 修改最小相关代码/配置
    code --> repair : 补丁
    repair --> orchestration : 变更说明与验证计划
    orchestration -> orchestration : 运行定向静态/单元检查
    orchestration -> cli : 从已知状态重新打开并复测
  else 环境、权限或需求阻塞
    cli --> report : 阻塞或需要决策
  end
end

cli --> report : 实际结果、截图、URL 和日志
deactivate cli
report --> author : 通过 / 部分通过 / 失败 / 阻塞

note over repair, code
  仅修改本次功能范围内的最小根因
  重试不能替代修复，也不能放宽断言
end note
@enduml
